hints.pseudocode:
let a be the shorter text, b the longer; if len(b) - len(a) > 1: return false
i = first position where a[i] != b[i] (or the end of a)
if i == len(a): return len(b) - len(a) == 1
if same lengths: return a[i+1:] == b[i+1:]   (replace)
else: return a[i:] == b[i+1:]                   (insert / delete)
